cription":"Lucan lifts the grille's pins, takes the Fork and retunes the whole harp to it overnight. The harp rings like a bell, and the trace shows a vast banded mass filling the waist: it is choking.","locationMarkerId":"yBmIaILRNsWH9U1mYNeIi","involvedCharacterIds":["lXowrO8WucvQ-z-5V8Y1Z"],"involvedItemIds":["VuHFhK4GdePcZFlHW2Gc2","4W7H7AXZt69yA9Bm8xOyk"],"tags":[],"id":"THBsTqir_QIx3ULEcfdlD","sortOrder":-2,"createdAt":1793109149538,"updatedAt":1793109171042,"version":9,"remoteCharacterIds":[]},{"travelDays":null,"inWorldTime":23,"tension":3,"structureBeat":null,"status":"draft","povCharacterId":"eZ6bZoVov0ITLh7fBrY_0","isFlashback":false,"mentionedCharacterIds":[],"threadIds":["_K3aJb1aHDBGtrGLmSbYZ","G2vQKK6meEnzZ9EFXlOcw"],"motifIds":["gQ_6swqJ5lW3yGhmN9POY","uRRXouZ1ANkDsIh6wIm9O"],"worldId":"os-ym7EwunyTMDieuRMb1","chapterId":"j1VCRiUth7uIAv2Y6xHkC","timelineId":"1Gt0Nmj9fSssszp28yFzc","title":"The Shard Sings","description":"At the retuned harp the shard hums hard. Isra knows the mass for glass, layered like the Returns' roots. The Returns are the throat trying to clear itself.","locationMarkerId":"yBmIaILRNsWH9U1mYNeIi","involvedCharacterIds":["eZ6bZoVov0ITLh7fBrY_0","lXowrO8WucvQ-z-5V8Y1Z"],"involvedItemIds":["ml_otw6g_nyvSGFk-YwIU"],"tags":[],"id":"Ths_2rRHebAxDhyJU5avw","sortOrder":-1,"createdAt":1793109149391,"updatedAt":1793109180591,"version":9,"remoteCharacterIds":[]},{"travelDays":null,"inWorldTime":31,"tension":5,"structureBeat":null,"status":"draft","povCharacterId":"ba36zRukMnL6eifQ8p0Lp","isFlashback":false,"mentionedCharacterIds":[],"threadIds":["eO_7QOdp0avWbvEC7OOfX","9yaD7eWlZcvjmZ6iUF8ff"],"motifIds":["PCXJLDRcGRTQ9mrzsfblI","gQ_6swqJ5lW3yGhmN9POY"],"worldId":"os-ym7EwunyTMDieuRMb1","chapterId":"_YizxoDDs2HC97Smr_hEY","timelineId":"ST4jdjCPlD6GmgCHSK16K","title":"The Trial","description":"Teo pathfinds the Brannock to the inner markers. Corrigan goes into the throat, describes it — drawn in like an iris, a light with no name — releases,