s get their beads and train in the simulators. At night in the harp hall Pell shows Adaeze her painting of the throat, which matches the oldest description in the archive.","locationMarkerId":"yBmIaILRNsWH9U1mYNeIi","involvedCharacterIds":["zO_Df258F-V33Vsnq0pOr","cTQk2fuL3YmSOlYDRwOM2","TC-L5WFMaTQ21rKCAn0bz"],"involvedItemIds":["4fwj7I9kcrMuNJAYIjRdp"],"tags":[],"id":"uwhWJbZQj0ns1hWP9t3B3","sortOrder":0,"createdAt":1793093539094,"updatedAt":1793093580338,"version":9,"remoteCharacterIds":[]},{"travelDays":null,"inWorldTime":22,"tension":3,"structureBeat":null,"status":"draft","povCharacterId":"TC-L5WFMaTQ21rKCAn0bz","isFlashback":false,"mentionedCharacterIds":[],"threadIds":["eBOv7USgNPYsH_prm_0Ed","eO_7QOdp0avWbvEC7OOfX"],"motifIds":["uRRXouZ1ANkDsIh6wIm9O"],"worldId":"os-ym7EwunyTMDieuRMb1","chapterId":"R9q7bnyO2byJQKiNOiT0F","timelineId":"PnoEuxRs-pnuhq1Nug1vk","title":"The Blank Year","description":"The archive begins on the morning after the First Keeping; forty-four years of records were taken by the First Warden. Adaeze strikes the Founder's Fork: it beats against the Hunger Tone.","locationMarkerId":"MdVb_7ATVe7LePJBC7kiu","involvedCharacterIds":["TC-L5WFMaTQ21rKCAn0bz"],"involvedItemIds":["VuHFhK4GdePcZFlHW2Gc2","4W7H7AXZt69yA9Bm8xOyk"],"tags":[],"id":"vc7JLtzv1t642c2LR_7a5","sortOrder":-1,"createdAt":1793108947382,"updatedAt":1793109023250,"version":8,"remoteCharacterIds":[]},{"travelDays":null,"inWorldTime":33,"tension":4,"structureBeat":null,"status":"draft","povCharacterId":"cxOiILo2zDng_KzycPfs7","isFlashback":false,"mentionedCharacterIds":[],"threadIds":["ePqBA24DL3HH2OjsKHoMk"],"motifIds":["8CmTnO92ZbAiueYnKULWV","E7dpHAGomtgYlj_PdF-Qi"],"worldId":"os-ym7EwunyTMDieuRMb1","chapterId":"_YizxoDDs2HC97Smr_hEY","timelineId":"ST4jdjCPlD6GmgCHSK16K","title":"Down Tools","description":"Shaft Nine sits down rather than cut Keeping glass; Brandt's men line the fence. Lulu scratches C. DACE — PILOT on the Tally.","locationMarkerId":"tVKCJ1ai6gWC5fjM8MH27","in